{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2021-05-07 12:00:00', 'title': 'SUPPORTING LOCAL COMMUNITIES: PG&E CONTRIBUTES $200,000 TO CELEBRATE AND SUPPORT THE ASIAN AMERICAN PACIFIC ISLANDER COMMUNITY', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IN HONOR OF ASIAN AMERICAN PACIFIC ISLANDER (AAPI) HERITAGE MONTH IN MAY, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL CONTRIBUTE $200,000 TO NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS THAT SUPPORT THE AAPI COMMUNITY, WITH A FOCUS ON SAFETY FOR INDIVIDUALS IN PG&E'S SERVICE AREA AND ACROSS THE COUNTRY. “I STAND IN CELEBRATION AND SOLIDARITY WITH MY AAPI COWORKERS AND NEIGHBORS THIS MONTH AND EVERY MONTH. WE CALL UPON EVERYONE IN OUR COMMUNITIES TO COME TO"}